      "page": "book",
      "text": "Print spec: 21×21 cm trim + 3 mm bleed each side = 216×216 mm → 816×816 px artboards. Red guide = trim line (11 px in). Blue guide = safe area (10 mm inside trim, 49 px from edge) — all text and faces stay inside it. Export as PDF/X at 300 dpi; illustrations generated at ≥2550 px square.",
      "w": 560,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360
    },
    "n_class": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "classbook",
      "text": "Class book = ONE shared story where every child appears N times, plus a personal cover per child. Readiness steps: invite → consent → photo → drawing (optional) → approved character. Planner warns when a child has fewer appearances than the target.",
      "w": 640,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300
    },
    "n_comp": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "companion",
      "text": "Step 4 of 12 (optional, skippable). Camera-first; drawing is auto-cropped and paper/shadows removed on device before upload. Companion gets 3 regenerations. Approved companion is saved to the parent account and can join any future book. The keepsake last page is added automatically when a companion exists.",
      "w": 640,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300
    },
    "n_create_1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 160,
      "page": "create",
      "text": "Mobile rule: the primary action is a sticky bottom bar (min 56px tall, safe-area padding). Back is a ghost button beside it. The stepper at the top is tappable only for completed steps.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1200
    },
    "n_create_3": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 160,
      "page": "create",
      "text": "Photo quality check runs client-side first (face count, blur, brightness) → instant tips, then server-side face detection. Rejected photos never leave the device; show the Photo rejected state (States page).",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1200
    },
    "n_create_5": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 160,
      "page": "create",
      "text": "Character sheet: 'Regenerate' is limited (e.g. 3 tries) — show remaining count. Approval locks the character for all pages, so every page looks like the same child.",
